Package: nexusR
Type: Package
Title: Nexus Pipeline Helpers for R Scripts
Version: 1.0.0
Description: Lets R scripts running in a Nexus pipeline receive the incoming data, parameters and
    secrets, and hand their result to the next step. Data moves between steps as Parquet files.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jsonlite, nanoparquet
Suggests: arrow
